{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arisa | Psychological Horror Game\u00a0<strong>is a 2.5D psychological horror game that tells the story of your younger sister\u2019s mysterious disappearance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Arisa receives a strange email \u2014 a disturbing message that leads you back to the ordinary school you attend every day. But the moment you step inside, one thing becomes crystal clear: Arisa is not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the truth hidden behind locked doors, dark hallways, and your fragile mind. <i>Arisa</i> blends narrative-driven exploration with atmospheric horror, blurring the line between reality and illusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Darkness of the Night</strong><br>In the middle of the night, you return to the school you know so well, following a strange message. What seems ordinary during the day turns into a nightmare that challenges the very boundaries of reality at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Immersive 2.5D Exploration</strong><br>Dark classrooms, echoing corridors, and an eerie atmosphere await you. Experience a cinematic sense of exploration with side-scrolling camera angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Narrative-Driven Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Collect fragmented memories of the past and follow the trail of your missing sister. Every piece of information you find pulls you deeper while testing your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>A Story Blended with Psychological Tension</strong><br>As you drift away from reality, you start asking yourself: <i>Is my sister really here?</i> The events will test you both mentally and emotionally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Atmospheric Audio and Visual Design</strong><br>Echoing footsteps in the darkness, eerie whispers\u2026 every detail draws you deeper into a haunting horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Run or RUN</strong><br>Hiding is not an option in this game. You must escape from what\u2019s following you. But this thing\u2026 it neither kills you nor lets you go. Every encounter turns into a chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player experience (approximately 1\u20132 hours of playtime)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror mechanics focused on escape rather than hiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depressing and eerie Japanese school atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple language support</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720640?t=1761446984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720640?t=1761446984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720640/e735acfa6100eedb79ff63e28ce4351c9e5bd886/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761446984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720640/e735acfa6100eedb79ff63e28ce4351c9e5bd886/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761446984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arisa | Psychological Horror Game\u00a0<strong>is a 2.5D psychological horror game that tells the story of your younger sister\u2019s mysterious disappearance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Arisa receives a strange email \u2014 a disturbing message that leads you back to the ordinary school you attend every day. But the moment you step inside, one thing becomes crystal clear: Arisa is not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the truth hidden behind locked doors, dark hallways, and your fragile mind. <i>Arisa</i> blends narrative-driven exploration with atmospheric horror, blurring the line between reality and illusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Survive the Darkness of the Night</strong><br>In the middle of the night, you return to the school you know so well, following a strange message. What seems ordinary during the day turns into a nightmare that challenges the very boundaries of reality at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfeb <strong>Immersive 2.5D Exploration</strong><br>Dark classrooms, echoing corridors, and an eerie atmosphere await you. Experience a cinematic sense of exploration with side-scrolling camera angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Narrative-Driven Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Collect fragmented memories of the past and follow the trail of your missing sister. Every piece of information you find pulls you deeper while testing your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>A Story Blended with Psychological Tension</strong><br>As you drift away from reality, you start asking yourself: <i>Is my sister really here?</i> The events will test you both mentally and emotionally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Atmospheric Audio and Visual Design</strong><br>Echoing footsteps in the darkness, eerie whispers\u2026 every detail draws you deeper into a haunting horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Run or RUN</strong><br>Hiding is not an option in this game. You must escape from what\u2019s following you. But this thing\u2026 it neither kills you nor lets you go. Every encounter turns into a chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player experience (approximately 1\u20132 hours of playtime)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror mechanics focused on escape rather than hiding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depressing and eerie Japanese school atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple language support</p></li></ul>","developers":["Otyken Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720640/8a42993c7bceeaf025ca26f8adee63b02f5f1f6c/header.jpg?t=1761446984","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Otyken Studio. All rights reserved.  <br />\r\nThis game was developed using the Unity game engine. Unity is a trademark or registered trademark of Unity Technologies.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux (64-bit).<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL I5 3470 | AMD R3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux (64-bit).<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> INTEL I5 10400 | AMD R5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3720640/883628/95ce0399a25d98